        "end": 661.08,
        "english": "Well, yeah, VP position is not easy, you know.",
        "chinese": "英语：嗯，没错，VP 位置不是容易的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 661.08,
        "end": 664.72,
        "english": "Hi, implement policies and procedures nationwide.",
        "chinese": "你好，全国范围内实施政策和程序。"
    },
    {
        "start": 664.72,
        "end": 669.76,
        "english": "Various departments, as well as trained junior managers and FDA and EPA regulations.",
        "chinese": "英语：各种部门，包括经过培训的初级管理人员和FDA和EPA法规。"
    },
    {
        "start": 669.76,
        "end": 675.12,
        "english": "I also have to oversee daily operations of our quality control for the entire East Coast.",
        "chinese": "我还要负责东海岸质量控制部的日常运营。"
    },
    {
        "start": 675.12,
        "end": 678.36,
        "english": "That alone means I have 1500 employees under me.",
        "chinese": "这个单反相机意味着我有1500名员工。"
    },
    {
        "start": 678.36,
        "end": 679.36,
        "english": "Wow.",
        "chinese": "英语：哇！"
    },
    {
        "start": 679.36,
        "end": 682.48,
        "english": "Yeah, that sounds exciting.",
        "chinese": "是的，听起来很有趣。"
    },
    {
        "start": 682.48,
        "end": 683.72,
        "english": "And what about you, Arthur?",
        "chinese": "英语：And what about you, Arthur?"
    },
    {
        "start": 683.72,
        "end": 685.48,
        "english": "What do you do for a living?",
        "chinese": "英语：你做什么工作？"
    },
    {
        "start": 685.48,
        "end": 688.36,
        "english": "Oh, I'm a top gun pilot.",
        "chinese": "英语：哦，我是顶级飞行员。"
    },
    {
        "start": 688.36,
        "end": 689.36,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 689.36,
        "end": 707.44,
        "english": "So, I have a little challenge for listeners today.",
        "chinese": "所以，今天我有一些小挑战给听众听。"
    },
    {
        "start": 707.44,
        "end": 708.44,
        "english": "What is it?",
        "chinese": "啥子？"
    },
    {
        "start": 708.44,
        "end": 709.6800000000001,
        "english": "Two challenges, actually.",
        "chinese": "两个挑战，实际上。"
    },
    {
        "start": 709.6800000000001,
        "end": 715.5600000000001,
        "english": "The first one, who performs the song that you heard and what is the song called?",
        "chinese": "英语：第一个，他唱的是你听过的那首歌。"
    },
    {
        "start": 715.5600000000001,
        "end": 716.5600000000001,
        "english": "Okay.",
        "chinese": "好的。"
    },
    {
        "start": 716.5600000000001,
        "end": 720.6400000000001,
        "english": "I don't know the answer, so I'm looking forward to seeing what users do.",
        "chinese": "我不会知道答案，所以我期待着用户的表现。"
    },
    {
        "start": 720.6400000000001,
        "end": 725.8000000000001,
        "english": "And the second one is, what is the number one company in the Fortune 500?",
        "chinese": "和第二个是，哪个公司是全球五百强的第一名？"
    },
    {
        "start": 725.8000000000001,
        "end": 728.8800000000001,
        "english": "Oh, I also don't know this answer.",
        "chinese": "英语：哦，我也不会回答这个问题。"
    },
    {
        "start": 728.8800000000001,
        "end": 729.8800000000001,
        "english": "Two great questions.",
        "chinese": "两个伟大的问题。"
    },
    {
        "start": 729.8800000000001,
        "end": 734.7600000000001,
        "english": "So, I expect to see your answers on the comments page, but also we want to know about your",
        "chinese": "所以，我希望能在评论页面看到你的回答，但我们也想了解一下你对这个话题的看法。"
    },
    {
        "start": 734.7600000000001,
        "end": 735.7600000000001,
        "english": "profession.",
        "chinese": "专业。"
    },
    {
        "start": 735.76,
        "end": 738.3199999999999,
        "english": "Yes, tell us about your job.",
        "chinese": "是的，请告诉我您的工作职责。"
    },
    {
        "start": 738.3199999999999,
        "end": 743.76,
        "english": "Tell us what you do and use some of the great phrases you learned today to describe your",
        "chinese": "请告诉我们您做什么，同时使用今天学习的一些好词句来描述您的。"
